"""PURGE UNINSTALLER V1.1 - Deep Cleaner

Windows only. Dependencies:
    py -m pip install customtkinter send2trash

Run:
    py purge_uninstaller.py

Safety model:
- Scans only common application folders and selected Software registry branches.
- Shows every candidate for manual review; nothing is deleted automatically.
- Files/folders are moved to the Recycle Bin using send2trash.
- Registry keys are exported to a .reg backup before deletion.
- Does not scan/delete Windows system folders or shared runtime components.
"""

